// Sign-ins to the Altiward console (with the role given) and sign-outs: single sign-on, and
// console token sign-ins, one each hour a token is used. A token's UserName is break-glass:
// and its fingerprint while single sign-on is on, otherwise token:.
// Tags: altiward
AltiwardOCSF_CL
| where ClassUid == 3002 and tostring(Ocsf.service.name) == "Altiward console"
| project TimeGenerated, UserName, Activity = tostring(Ocsf.activity_name), Message
| order by TimeGenerated desc
